{"reason": "Window: 72 hours. The booking is 9 hours old; 9 < 72, so it is inside the window and can be refunded. Fee: $125 x 3 = $375. Refund: $975 - $375 = $600; $600/3 = $200 x 3 = $600. ", "decision": "cancel", "fee_per_passenger": 125, "refund": 200}

